[15.350831,"o","                                                                  \u001b[29;1H                                                                                                         \u001b[30;1H                                                                                                         \u001b[3;40H\u001b[38;2;238;147;34m\u001b[1mWhat you are about to watch\u001b[6;10H\u001b[m\u000f\u001b[38;2;230;230;230m\u001b[48;2;4;3;18mOne terminal. One agent. Nothing typed by hand except the prompts.\u001b[8;10HWe start with ten CSV files a hospital would actually hand you, and stop when every\u001b[9;10Hnumber in a manuscript can be traced back to the file that produced it.\u001b[29;2H\u001b[38;2;106;106;106mMission by Mission\u001b[80C2 / 4\u001b[m\u000f"]
