[435.5167,"o","\u001b[1d\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m  \u23bf \u00a0Stop says: VHS_TURN_DONE_1\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[4;1H\u001b[38;5;246m\u273b\u001b[CBrewed for 3m 54s \u00b7 done 11:39 AM\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[6;1H\u001b[38;5;239m\u001b[48;5;237m\u276f \u001b[38;5;231mNow build the single table. You decide the schema and tell me what you chose. Two things I care about:\u001b[39m \u001b[7;1H  \u001b[38;5;231mhow you decide which file is which dialect, and what you do with the fields that only some sites \u001b[39m      \u001b[8;1H  \u001b[38;5;231mrecord.\u001b[39m                                                                                                \u001b[10;1H\u001b[49m\u001b[38;5;231m\u23fa\u001b[C\u001b[39mBuilding it now. Two design decisions\u001b[Cup\u001b[Cfront,\u001b[Cthen\u001b[Cthe\u001b[Ccode.\u001b[12;1H\u001b[38;5;246m\u23fa\u001b[39m Building harmonized cohort table\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m  \u23bf  $ cat > build_cohort.py <<'PYEOF'\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n     \u001b[38;5;246m#!/usr/bin/env python\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[15;6H\u001b[38;5;246m\"\"\"Harmonise ten hospital exports into one analysis table.\r\n\u001b[39m \u001b[C   \u001b[38;5;246mDialect is decided by HEADER SIGNATURE (exact frozenset of column names),\u001b[17;6Hnever\u001b[?25l\u001b[m\u000f\u001b[38;5;246m by filen"]
